	<Description>Flat lens: a plane wave of frequency 50 (32 px) through a meta lens, a 20 px plate of index 1.5 carrying ridges of index 2.00, 32 px high in cells of 4 px, whose fill delays the wave as a lens of focal length 300 would; the lens is 400 px wide (f/0.75). The point probe Focus sits 300 px behind the lens, the line probe Focal plane across it; the spot is about 24 px wide (wavelength times focal length over width).</Description>
